    "updated_at": "2017-08-30T04:53:44Z",
    "body": "No; they have dependencies on many many concepts which were main-thread specific, like for example their base class, HTMLElement, or its base class, Element, or its base class, Node.\r\n\r\nYou would need to drag the entire DOM implementation into the worker, and I can pretty confidently state that is not something we're interested in.\r\n\r\nAs such, I'm going to close this. But perhaps you could open a new issue, describing your use case, and *not* your proposed solution. See https://whatwg.org/faq#adding-new-features steps 1-3.",
